  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection of vulnerable communities and survivors in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the core project covering major protection activities of Oxfam in Bangladesh. Project Title: &quot;Enhancing local capacity for integrated livelihoods, gender and protection response to Covid -19 and Disaster Risks of Rohingya and Host communities in Bangladesh&quot;. The project addresses the negative impacts from disasters and conflicts and tries to improve livelihoods access and protection for refugees and Bangladeshi communities.</narrative>
  </description>
